is $2.$ Find $P(x).$" 13194139534417 true] [17592186287139 1113 #uuid "cf0a857f-eb4a-58c2-829d-65dd64e57db8" 13194139534417 true] [17592186287139 1145 "Since our cubic polynomial has roots ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=-2$ and ${x}_{3}=5,$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $a=2,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2})(x-{x}_{3}) & =2(x-(-2))(x-(-2))(x-5) \\\\  & =2(x+2)(x+2)(x-5)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2(x+2)(x+2)(x-5) & =2({x}^{2}+4x+4)(x-5) \\\\  & =2({x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}-5{x}^{2}+4x-20x-20) \\\\  & =2({x}^{3}-{x}^{2}-16x-20) \\\\  & =2{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}-32x-40.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x)=2{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}-32x-40.$" 13194139534417 true] [17592186287140 1000 #edb/ref 17592186287141 13194139534417 true] [17592186287140 1000 #edb/ref 17592186287142 13194139534417 true] [17592186287140 1000 #edb/ref 17592186287143 13194139534417 true] [17592186287140 1000 #edb/ref 17592186287144 13194139534417 true] [17592186287140 1000 #edb/ref 17592186287145 13194139534417 true] [17592186287140 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534417 true] [17592186287140 1041 "selection" 13194139534417 true] [17592186287140 1104 #edb/ref 17592186287142 13194139534417 true] [17592186287140 1110 #uuid "4b4c696e-5012-5f5d-8cfd-6336391f1335" 13194139534417 true] [17592186287141 1034 "-2{x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}+32x-20" 13194139534417 true] [17592186287141 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534417 true] [17592186287141 1111 #uuid "27e78b09-c56d-5859-b1a3-a04022b0e24d" 13194139534417 true] [17592186287142 1034 "2{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}-32x-40" 13194139534417 true] [17592186287142 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534417 true] [17592186287142 1111 #uuid "dfc34472-7c66-587f-8c25-f275ec9452d0" 13194139534417 true] [17592186287143 1034 "{x}^{3}-{x}^{2}-16x-20" 13194139534417 true] [17592186287143 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534417 true] [17592186287143 1111 #uuid "a7de367a-7e35-5907-8632-6d394448c9cd" 1